Netscape Navigator from the 1998 Mozilla Classic source release (the tree
that would have become Communicator 5.0, before the move to Gecko): the
classic layout engine, JavaScript 1.3 and the Motif front end.

This package builds the browser only (MOZ_LITE: no mail/news, editor,
LDAP or calendar), brought forward for IRIX with TLS from OpenSSL in place
of the security code stripped from the source release.
